    "name": "DustUI Android root scan diagnostics and failure notices",
    "description": "Adds truthful root-service identity and scan-root preflight, fatal root-open handling, retained scanner warnings and errno context, explicit zero-file/truncation/depth/mount notices, and module-source diagnostics with a dedicated modules scan action. Revision 1.0.7 preserves the green compile and 173-test tree, fixes both package URI intents with String.toUri(), converts Tasker result bundles to bundleOf(), and adds whole-tree AndroidX KTX, minSdk, StateFlow, and Compose compatibility gates.",
